<section image-layout="blank" id="q1EwWyu_Qr" background-color="heading"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="JBPrIAp-x9" vertical-align="center" colspan="45"><p role="eyebrow">Leadership operating loop</p><h2 font-size="32pt">Decide. Measure. Adapt.</h2><grid divider="sm palette-5" marker="number" marker-style="solid" marker-shape="circle" marker-position="inline" spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug" style="--marker-inline-size:28pt; --marker-gap:10pt;"><grid-item id="IsD1I75cXY" colspan="30" padding="12pt"><h4>Today · ELT decides</h4><p font-size="16pt">Set onboarding, pricing, and capacity interventions; confirm owners.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="PZneP-5dfj" colspan="30" padding="12pt"><h4>Day 30 · COO &amp; CFO measure</h4><p font-size="16pt">Report pod staffing, pricing compliance, pipeline coverage, and onboarding time.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="-jOwRK1Bzp" colspan="30" padding="12pt"><h4>Day 60 · ELT adapts</h4><p font-size="16pt">Release contingency capacity if coverage stays below 2.8× or onboarding remains above 14 days.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="KgXuriH4nn" colspan="30" padding="12pt"><h4>Quarter end · ELT assesses</h4><p font-size="16pt">Scale only when revenue, margin, retention, and cash improve together.</p></grid-item></grid><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="FOTt-SHdLu" background-color="accent" padding="9pt 12pt"><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item colspan="39" vertical-align="center"><p font-size="16pt"><b>Decision rule:</b> no scaling without leading-indicator proof.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="21" vertical-align="center"><p role="caption" align="right">Illustrative example — not company data.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="Ox2nw-WytX" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.2" vertical-align="end" padding="18pt 18pt 48pt" colspan="15"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/E3saE4HNdEA3QgB0bVJSf.png" saved-media-id="6fidw9fjfzf7i2s" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="causal-model-studio" alt="Editorial studio photograph of a closed-loop tabletop operating model made from matte warm-white card and machined aluminum, four linked stations connected by a continuous graphite rail, one signal-red decision lever and restrained green indicators showing protected value returning to the starting gate, crisp directional light, no text, lettering, screens, logos, or people." meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}" /><p role="caption">Concept model · operating loop, not company evidence.</p></grid-item></grid></section>